---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<head>
  <title>seafloorsegueSMP</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Setup instructions for joining the Minecraft server." />
</head>

<Layout>
    <main>
        <a class="button" href="/">Back</a>
        <header class="word-header">
			<h1>seafloorsegueSMP</h1>
			<span class="pronunciation">/smp.seafloorsegue.net/</span>
		</header>

		<a href="https://map.seafloorsegue.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">map.seafloorsegue.net</a>

		<p></p>

        <!-- <p class="word-class">noun</p>
		<ol>
			<li>A modded Minecraft: Java Edition 26.3 survival multiplayer server.</li>
			<li><a href="https://map.seafloorsegue.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">map.seafloorsegue.net</a></li>
		</ol> -->

		<p class="word-class">conditions</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Only one player needs to go to bed to sleep through the night.</li>
			<li>Fire spread is disabled.</li>
			<li>The End is locked until an agreed time for the final fight is decided.</li>
            <li>Don't be a dick.</li>
        </ol>

        <p class="word-class">setup instructions</p>
        <ol>
            <li><a href="https://prismlauncher.org/download/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download Prism Launcher.</a></li>
            <li>Open it and sign in to your Microsoft account. <span>(you must own <i>Minecraft: Java Edition)</i></span></li>
            <li>Click "Add Instance" in the top left.</li>
            <li>Go to "Import from zip", paste the following into the field, then hit "OK":
				<div class="copy-box">
  					<code id="server-modpack">https://seafloorsegue.net/download/seafloorsegueSMP.mrpack</code>
  					<button class="copy-btn" data-copy="server-modpack">Copy</button>
				</div>
			</li>
			<li>You'll get a warning about <i>weatherglass</i>. Tick the box saying you trust me then hit OK.</li>
            <li>After downloading, right-click the instance and select "Edit".</li>
			<li>Go to "Settings", then the "Java" tab.</li>
			<li>Tick the box for "Java Arguments" then paste the following into the field:
				<div class="copy-box">
  					<code id="java-args">-XX:+UseZGC -XX:+ZGenerational</code>
  					<button class="copy-btn" data-copy="java-args">Copy</button>
				</div>
			</li>
			<li>Hit "Close" in the bottom right. You can now launch the instance.</li>
            <li>Go to Multiplayer to join. Oh and tell me your Java Edition username to be whitelisted.</li>
        </ol>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  body {
    background: #111111;
    color: #eeeeee;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 700px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .button {
	color: #4c4c4c;
	font-style: italic;
	margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .word-header {
    	display: flex;
    	flex-wrap: wrap;
    	align-items: baseline;
    	gap: 12px;
  	}

	h1 {
    	font-size: 3rem;
	}

	.word-header h1 {
    	margin: 0px;
	}

	span {
    	color: #aaaaaa;
  	}

	.word-header span {
		height: 2rem;
	}

	p {
		color: #eeeeee; line-height: 1.7;
	}

	p + p {
  		margin-top: 2.4rem;
	}

	.word-class{
		line-height: 0rem;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	li {
		padding-left: 0.7rem;
		line-height: 2rem;
	}

	li::marker {
		color: #888888;
	}

	a {
		color: #eeeeee;
		font-weight: bold;
		font-style: italic;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

  	a:hover {
    	text-decoration: underline;
  	}

	.copy-box {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		border: 1px solid #444;
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: #111;
	}

	.copy-box code {
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.copy-btn {
		padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
		background: #333;
		color: white;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 4px;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.copy-btn:hover {
		background: #555;
	}

	.copy-btn:active {
		background: #777;
	}
</style>

<script>
	document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>(".copy-btn").forEach((button) => {
		button.addEventListener("click", async () => {
			const targetId = button.dataset.copy;
			if (!targetId) return;

			const text = document.getElementById(targetId)?.textContent?.trim();
			if (!text) return;

			try {
				await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);

				button.textContent = "Copied!";
				setTimeout(() => {
					button.textContent = "Copy";
				}, 2000);
			} catch (err) {
				console.error("Failed to copy text:", err);
				button.textContent = "Failed";
			}
		});
	});
</script>